note /allen/ page skeleton generator. Every structural decision for the chat window lives in this
note unit: the masthead, the speed table and its order, the message log, the example prompts, the
note form controls, the privacy note and the source links. allen-js.om only fills these slots.
note
note Program mode, composed with contract.om and allen-js.om by check.sh. The pinned compiler emits
note a static AArch64 ELF: skeleton on stdout, browser script on fd 3, shared ~N~ contract tokens.
note check.sh runs it twice and commits deterministic HTML and JavaScript with sha256 sidecars.
note
note speeds holds label and id fields alternately, separated by byte 124: each pair becomes one
note dt and dd row in table order. prompts holds the example prompts, one button each, in order.
note No field may contain byte 124 or a newline.

text pg1 "<div class=\"allen\" id=\"~0~\" data-ready=\"false\" data-busy=\"false\" data-mode=\"anonymous\">\n<canvas id=\"allen-universe\" class=\"allen-universe\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Explore the universe with Allen. Drag to drift, scroll to zoom, or use arrow keys, plus, minus and Home.\"></canvas>\n<nav class=\"allen-space-nav\" aria-label=\"Allen controls\"><a href=\"/\" class=\"allen-tool\">Back to AienOS</a><span class=\"allen-space-title\">Allen</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"allen-tool\" id=\"allen-mute\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Sound on</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"allen-tool\" id=\"allen-projects\">Projects</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"allen-tool\" id=\"allen-history\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"allen-session\">Session</button></nav>\n<div class=\"allen-arrival\" id=\"allen-arrival\"><h1>Explore the universe with Allen</h1><button type=\"button\" class=\"allen-enter\" id=\"allen-enter\">Enter Allen's universe</button><p>The opening sound plays only after you enter. Sound is optional.</p></div>\n<div id=\"allen-panes\" class=\"allen-panes\" aria-label=\"Your workspace\"></div>\n<section class=\"allen-current\" aria-label=\"Latest exchange\"><p id=\"allen-guest\" class=\"allen-guest\"></p><p id=\"allen-speaker\" class=\"allen-speaker\">Allen</p><div id=\"allen-answer\" class=\"allen-answer\" data-speaker=\"allen\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"false\"></div><div class=\"allen-reply-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"allen-tool\" id=\"allen-copy\">Copy reply</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"allen-tool\" id=\"allen-regenerate\">Regenerate</button></div></section>\n<section class=\"allen-panel\" aria-label=\"Conversation with Allen\">\n<p class=\"allen-mode\"><span id=\"~50~\">Anonymous: Allen won&#39;t remember this chat</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"allen-tool\" id=\"~35~\">Remember me</button></p>\n<section id=\"allen-session\" class=\"allen-session\" aria-label=\"Session history and privacy\" hidden><header class=\"allen-head\"><h2 class=\"allen-title\">This session</h2><p class=\"allen-lede\" id=\"~26~\">Ask about the universe, explore an idea, or make something with Allen.</p><p class=\"allen-where\">Model <code id=\"~8~\">~24~</code>. Timing below is measured from this reply.</p></header>\n<dl class=\"allen-speed\" aria-label=\"Speed of the latest reply\">\n"
text speeds "Wait in line|~9~|First token, model|~10~|First token, from Send|~11~|Tokens per second|~12~|Tokens streamed|~13~|Server count|~14~"
text rowa "<div class=\"allen-stat\"><dt>"
text rowb "</dt><dd id=\""
text rowc "\">-</dd></div>\n"
text pg2 "</dl>\n<div class=\"allen-scroll\"><ol class=\"allen-log\" id=\"~1~\" role=\"log\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-label=\"Messages\"></ol></div>\n<noscript><p class=\"allen-status\">Allen needs JavaScript to draw the scene and stream replies. Nothing is sent without it.</p></noscript>\n<div class=\"allen-examples\" id=\"~15~\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Example questions\">\n"
text prompts "What is Omega?|Make me a calculator|Write an Omega gcd function|How fast are you?"
text btna "<button type=\"button\" class=\"allen-example\">"
text btnb "</button>\n"
text pg3 "</div>\n<p class=\"allen-contact\">To reach me, Drake, directly: <a href=\"~48~\" rel=\"noopener\">follow me on X</a> or email <a href=\"mailto:~49~\">~49~</a>.</p>\n<p class=\"allen-privacy\" id=\"~27~\">This session stays in this tab. Reloading clears the conversation. Projects are saved on this device only when you choose Save. Remembering you is a separate choice; <a href=\"/privacy/\">read what I keep</a>.</p>\n<details class=\"allen-keypanel\" id=\"~39~\" data-key=\"no\"><summary>Your Allen key</summary><div class=\"allen-keybody\" id=\"~40~\"><p class=\"allen-note\">Your Allen key needs JavaScript.</p></div></details>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"allen-tool allen-new\" id=\"~7~\">New conversation</button>\n<p class=\"allen-foot\">The browser controller is <a href=\"/allen/scene.om\">written in Omega</a>. The scene uses the <a href=\"https://github.com/aien-dev/aienux/tree/da55660ea7337f2b6a42095fcd1fb6ddebe1cc7c/native/kernel/ui\" rel=\"noopener\">same native iMac renderer</a>, compiled to WebAssembly.</p>\n<p class=\"allen-foot\"><a href=\"/alpha/\">Own a DGX Spark? Run Sovereign Intelligence on yours</a>.</p></section>\n<div class=\"allen-bottom\"><p class=\"allen-drake\" id=\"~47~\" aria-live=\"polite\" hidden></p><p class=\"allen-status\" id=\"~6~\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n<form class=\"allen-form\" id=\"~2~\"><label class=\"allen-sr\" for=\"~3~\">Message to Allen</label><textarea id=\"~3~\" rows=\"1\" maxlength=\"~19~\" placeholder=\"Speak to Allen\" autocomplete=\"off\"></textarea><div class=\"allen-actions\"><button type=\"submit\" class=\"allen-send\" id=\"~4~\" aria-label=\"Send message\">Send</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"allen-stop\" id=\"~5~\" disabled>Stop</button></div></form><p class=\"allen-input-hint\">Enter to send. Shift+Enter for a new line.</p></div>\n</section>\n</div>\n"

fn emit1 to void
for b ulong len pg1
byteput get pg1 b
end
end

fn emit2 to void
for b ulong len pg2
byteput get pg2 b
end
end

fn emit3 to void
for b ulong len pg3
byteput get pg3 b
end
end

fn rowopen to void
for b ulong len rowa
byteput get rowa b
end
end

fn rowmid to void
for b ulong len rowb
byteput get rowb b
end
end

fn rowend to void
for b ulong len rowc
byteput get rowc b
end
end

fn btnopen to void
for b ulong len btna
byteput get btna b
end
end

fn btnend to void
for b ulong len btnb
byteput get btnb b
end
end

note Even fields are labels, odd fields are ids: a separator after a label opens the dd, a
note separator after an id closes the row and opens the next one.
fn statrows to void
p = ulong 0
k = ulong 0
rowopen
while lt p len speeds
c = get speeds p
if eq c 124
if eq rem k 2 0
rowmid
else
rowend
rowopen
end
k = add k 1
else
byteput c
end
p = add p 1
end
rowend
end

fn examples to void
p = ulong 0
btnopen
while lt p len prompts
c = get prompts p
if eq c 124
btnend
btnopen
else
byteput c
end
p = add p 1
end
btnend
end

fn main to int
put target 0 1
emit1
statrows
emit2
examples
emit3
flush
javascript
ret 0
end
